The WoW Forever game data file (backend/games/wow-forever/src/main/resources/wow-forever/data.json) comes from talentsforever.com (https://talentsforever.com) and is used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The web app shows that credit on every page that uses the data. World of Warcraft names, icons and game text belong to Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.

The WoW Forever launcher news come from the public RSS feed of Wowhead (https://www.wowhead.com/news/rss/forever). The app only shows the title, the short summary, the date and the picture of each item, as the feed publishes them, with a link to the full article on Wowhead and a "Fuente: Wowhead" credit; it never copies the articles. The pictures are loaded straight from Wowhead's servers and are not stored. Wowhead news, texts and pictures belong to Wowhead and their authors. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Wowhead.

